<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-03T01:42:30.386Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 01:42:30 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The RSF has intensified drone strikes on Sudan's power infrastructure, hitting stations in the east and across multiple states, causing widespread blackouts. The Sudanese army reports repelling RSF attacks in Blue Nile and securing fuel supplies while repairing the damaged grid. Displaced Sudanese in South Darfur's Kalma camp face imminent famine as food and medicine run out. The Sudanese government has lodged complaints with the UN and African Union accusing Ethiopia of backing the cross-border drone attacks. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168703&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxONzRGVHdVb1U0ckxCRUZwZW5MX1hyZExrU0RwbFV3SEZfRVlzQ3dQRmJ2NFpiMEVHNFNfU1pXSlR0aEhPWkdlMGlMY0YxalNxNG4yeERHME9qWmJUc1hkVDJobVl1SHVsX3NlS1N6YWtHWnVqejdCQzNpOEZQMkotWWQxTkJIaHU0YWxhdmQ5aWhlSWFPNnd5RnZzZU83Q1VZa29udXdzbw?oc=5&quot;&gt;OCHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NewsCord&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxOb1ZhZ3dhM0tpRV9DQ3l1SmI0T2ZyXzA5akVKcTh4cllIRVZTeEttVmFtdHRMSmZjbV9uR1VlZG1JVzlQTy1ZVEwyWkU2RVhIaWNIZXdGRXo1MjlNMG00TzZKdDh3bjUtMUVsSENmZS1FRGdmWVVnaWV5aW51Y0t4TjhDN0RWcHhLai1oS1JIY1JoQ2x1R214ZXFxYmdUQm9BbGltVTFqNWkxTmN5TDRqSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTFBvakVZbWY1b0NudkMzU0pTV1RPdFdheHh5RWtvN050TW1JSVQ3b0pGSWw0TEtsZURqRUJNRnV3UGVFc1haM3M2TWhzX3FRdVE4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxOaVdFTlZVQlkxQ01kMktWd1JF